WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:02.836
♪♪

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.054
(kids giggling)

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:14.139
Wake up, monster.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:16.141
(all chattering, giggling)

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:28.528
There's a reason
we're all put on this Earth.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.322
One purpose to everything.

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:43.627
On the course of our life,
we come to understand why.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.340
Why me?

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:52.219
Sometimes it's many things.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.472
Most times, it's just one.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.977
One reason for everything.

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:05.399
After all these years,
there is nothing...

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.070
...until today.

00:01:11.446 --> 00:01:13.532
All these signs.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:18.036
Maybe God has given me
something.

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:23.000
Something bigger.

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:28.088
Maybe this is the point.

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:31.717
It's the point to all of this.

00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:41.685
We would finally have our stand.

